      "role": "user",
      "content": "i'm just a bit nervous because sometimes my heart races a little when i'm stressed, and i don't want to end up in the ER. if i do decide to take it, how much can i safely take to make sure the congestion actually goes away? like, can i take a double dose if the first one doesn't work?",
